generalized eigenvector of rank $3$ \ncorresponding to the eigenvalue $\\lambda =2$ of $A.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\"" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362668 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362669 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362668 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362670 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362668 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362671 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362668 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362672 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362668 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362673 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362668 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362668 1077 "selection" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362668 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362670 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362668 1080 #uuid "1ca3db62-944b-5b80-aff1-85fe1dd99a9a" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362669 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362669 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362669 1084 #uuid "2b503f20-57d3-523f-a975-260f478cf39d" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362670 1081 "I and III only" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362670 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362670 1084 #uuid "51c0ce16-d75f-5fa7-820e-b3ab9aa1cd62" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362671 1081 "III only" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362671 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362671 1084 #uuid "b04b9106-cf83-5fdb-a86a-3fa23d077114" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362672 1081 "I and II only" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362672 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362672 1084 #uuid "e6550c11-4a77-5d81-a677-6a80f6093d5f" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362673 1081 "II only" 13194139533446 175921860