genvector of rank $3$ corresponding to the eigenvalue $\\lambda =-1$ of $A.$*\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"None of the statements are true.\"" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362689 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362690 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362689 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362691 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362689 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362692 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362689 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362693 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362689 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362694 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362689 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362689 1077 "selection" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362689 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362690 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362689 1080 #uuid "dc073027-8d63-5f72-bb4e-ddd774541c01" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362690 1081 "None of the statements are true" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362690 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362690 1084 #uuid "2f322b92-e727-56f8-b965-168eeb7ec238" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362691 1081 "I only" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362691 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362691 1084 #uuid "fea449ab-857f-5e97-a2dd-9a5decfbfe3b" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362692 1081 "III only" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362692 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362692 1084 #uuid "e5e9c614-fb32-5fc3-a8e1-80768c7a6164" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362693 1081 "I and II only" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362693 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362693 1084 #uuid "fd8fd250-9f94-565b-afb8-d6406e6e4d2c" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362694 1081 "II only" 13194139533446 17592