ximation is given by\n\n$$\nL(x)=\\operatorname{ln}⁡2+\\frac{3}{2}(x-2).\n$$\n\nNow, we can approximate $f(3)$ by evaluating the tangent line approximation at $x=3.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(3) & ≈L(3) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡2+\\frac{3}{2}(3-2) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡2+\\frac{3}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362901 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362902 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362901 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362903 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362901 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362904 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362901 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362905 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362901 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362906 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362901 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362901 1077 "selection" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362901 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362905 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362901 1080 #uuid "3df600e6-c5fa-5332-b8b4-c082d25ec3de" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362902 1081 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡3+\\operatorname{ln}⁡4" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362902 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362902 1084 #uuid "7aa9024c-f185-5a16-b4fe-d68ff17e9ff0" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362903 1081 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡3+2" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362903 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362903 1084 #uuid "66501742-7f3a-5f65-8c0a-4f29d57a767a" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362904 1081 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡2+3" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362904 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362904 1084 #uuid "080bcfba-54df-5ebb-9b57-a55f3cbca8f4" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362905 1081 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡2+\\frac{3}{2}" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true]