$ | $+$ |\n\nOf the remaining options, the only one that gives this behavior is\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=(y+3)(y-1).\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is ${y}^{′}=(y+3)(y-1).$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362914 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362915 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362914 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362916 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362914 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362917 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362914 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362918 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362914 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362919 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362914 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362914 1077 "selection" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362914 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362916 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362914 1080 #uuid "35e7a510-a696-5518-80ff-933352904524" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362915 1081 "{y}^{′}=(y-1)^{2}" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362915 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362915 1084 #uuid "6a3e6444-c825-5646-9dc2-c61c4fd5997a" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362916 1081 "{y}^{′}=(y+3)(y-1)" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362916 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362916 1084 #uuid "905b475a-2d04-5a88-aab4-d1644af0f48f" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362917 1081 "{y}^{′}=(y+3)(y-1)^{2}" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362917 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362917 1084 #uuid "eeedbc55-1a00-574e-a3a4-b3bcde35705e" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362918 1081 "{y}^{′}=(y+1)(y-3)" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362918 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186362918 1084 #uuid "294905ab-2759-5288-8bf7-d3a50b859f74" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186