d{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $c=⟨{c}_{1},{c}_{2}⟩$ satisfies the equation of the line, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{c}_{2} & ={c}_{1}+3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, taking into account that ${c}_{2}=3,$ we obtain that ${c}_{1}=3-3=0.$ So, the point $C$ that satisfies the mean value theorem is $(0,3).$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363059 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363060 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363059 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363061 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363059 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363062 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363059 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363063 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363059 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363064 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363059 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363059 1077 "selection" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363059 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363061 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363059 1080 #uuid "5becb77d-49a9-50d4-b8e0-7570e3f9bb49" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363060 1081 "(-\\frac{1}{2},1)" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363060 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363060 1084 #uuid "a8e6ec4e-2f64-51f4-8b66-077939d3ee90" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363061 1081 "(0,3)" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363061 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363061 1084 #uuid "fafc3ba1-8874-5ce3-9023-4bed5913b1c5" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363062 1081 "(1,4)" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363062 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363062 1084 #uuid "64311c21-5881-5cd4-af34-d8fc20975e51" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363063 1081 "(0,\\frac{5}{2})" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363063 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186