gin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({a}_{ij}+{b}_{ij}) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{a}_{ij}+{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{b}_{ij}, \\\\ {\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}k{a}_{ij} & =k{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{a}_{ij}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying these rules to the given sum, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{70}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{80}2({a}_{ij}+{b}_{ij}) & =2{\\sum }_{i=1}^{70}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{80}({a}_{ij}+{b}_{ij}) \\\\  & =2{\\sum }_{i=1}^{70}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{80}{a}_{ij}+2{\\sum }_{i=1}^{70}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{80}{b}_{ij} \\\\  & =2\\cdot 75+2\\cdot 70 \\\\  & =150+140 \\\\  & =290.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363363 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363364 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363363 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363365 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363363 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363366 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363363 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363367 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363363 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363368 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363363 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363363 1077 "selection" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363363 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363364 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363363 1080 #uuid "124f2ea4-8962-5c37-981c-eb8bf3d6792a" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363364 1081 "290" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363364 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363364 1084 #uuid "fa5d56cd-f108-5944-b5e9-334529556e58" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363365 1081 "270" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363365 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363365 1084 #uuid "cb962620-1ee5-5e03-9e8e-d659f3968ac2" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363366 1081 "260" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [175921863