\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}\\theta }=-{e}^{-\\theta }.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the expression for our line integral is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s & ={\\int }_{{\\theta }_{1}}^{{\\theta }_{2}}\\sqrt{{r}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}\\theta })}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\sqrt{{({e}^{-\\theta })}^{2}+{(-{e}^{\\theta })}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\sqrt{{e}^{-2\\theta }+{e}^{-2\\theta }}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\sqrt{2{e}^{-2\\theta }}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{e}^{-\\theta }\\,\\text{d}\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363370 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363371 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363370 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363372 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363370 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363373 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363370 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363374 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363370 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363375 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363370 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363370 1077 "selection" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363370 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363372 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363370 1080 #uuid "5703c778-a247-5102-af88-f5464e7312d0" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363371 1081 "2{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{e}^{-\\theta /2}\\,\\text{d}\\theta " 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363371 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363371 1084 #uuid "2ec25039-c0fd-56ca-b984-bd9349c79ceb" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363372 1081 "\\sqrt{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{e}^{-\\theta }\\,\\text{d}\\theta " 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363372 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363372 1084 #uuid "93316eec-08b8-5888-