 drag." 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363873 1072 #uuid "0e89c2a1-0002-5679-bf02-d2a7ef974378" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363873 1074 "First, note that only two forces act on the block: the force due to gravity, given by the weight\n\n$$\nw=mg=15g\n$$\n\nand the force due to drag $D,$ which is proportional to the velocity squared (and negative since it acts in the negative direction):\n\n$$\nD=-k{v}^{2}=-1.47{v}^{2}\n$$\n\nHence, the resultant force acting on the block is\n\n$$\nF=w+D=15g-1.47{v}^{2}.\n$$\n\nApplying Newton's second law, we obtain a separable first-order differential equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F & =ma \\\\ 15g-1.47{v}^{2} & =15\\,\\frac{dv}{dt} \\\\ \\frac{dv}{dt} & =g-0.098{v}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeparating variables and integrating both sides with respect to $t,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dv}{dt} & =g(1-0.01{v}^{2}) \\\\ \\frac{1}{1-0.01{v}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{dv}{dt} & =g \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{1-0.01{v}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{dv}{dt}\\,dt & =g\\int dt \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{1-(0.1v)^{2}}\\,dv & =g\\int dt \\\\ \\frac{1}{0.1}\\operatorname{artanh}⁡(0.1v) & =gt+{C}_{1} \\\\ \\operatorname{artanh}⁡(0.1v) & =\\frac{1}{10}gt+C \\\\ 0.1v & =\\operatorname{tanh}⁡(\\frac{1}{10}gt+C) \\\\ v(t) & =10\\operatorname{tanh}⁡(\\frac{1}{10}gt+C),\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C=0.1{C}_{1}$ is a constant of integration.\n\nWe're told that the block is released with an initial velocity of $1\\,\\text{m/s}.$ So, we can apply the initial condition $v(0)=1,$ and solve for $C:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(0) & =10\\operatorname{tanh}⁡(\\frac{1}{10}g\\cdot 0+C) \\\\ 1 & =10\\operatorname{tanh}⁡(C) \\\\ \\operatorname{tanh}⁡(C) & =0.1 \\\\ C & =\\operatorname{artanh}⁡(0.1)≈0.100\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have the following expression for $v(t):$\n\n$$\nv(t)=10\\operatorname{tanh}⁡(\\frac{1}{10}gt+0.100)\n$$\n\nFinally, the velocity of the block after $t=1$ second is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(1) & =10\\operatorname{tanh}⁡(\\frac{1}{10}\\cdot 9.8\\cdot 1+0.100) \\\\  & =10\\operatorname{tanh}⁡(0.98+0.100) \\\\  & =7.931\\,99… \\\\  & ≈7.93\\,\\text{m/s},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to two decimal places." 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363874 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363875 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363874 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363876 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363874 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363877 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363874 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363878 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363874 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363879 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363874 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363874 1077 "selection" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363874 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363877 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363874 1080 #uuid "b2c03cfc-242a-519b-9f14-4ba61dfdecb8" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363875 1081 "7.23\\,\\text{m/s}" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363875 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363875 1084 #uuid "60f5adde-0d41-52ed-beaa-b8f747e70968" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363876 1081 "8.69\\,\\text{m/s}" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363876 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363876 1084 #uuid "03dc2957-b150-5ed3-b893-ec087774185b" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363877 1081 "7.93\\,\\text{m/s}" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363877 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363877 1084 #uuid "8d8e1ae9-fa54-59c9-b2d2-b164145d1e03" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363878 1081 "8.09\\,\\text{m/s}" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363878 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363878 1084 #uuid "d203da3a-d07e-5c64-9a14-237812e230e1" 13194139533446 17592186045585 tr