\n$$\nw=mg=500g\n$$\n\nand the force due to drag $D,$ which is proportional to the velocity squared (and negative since it acts in the negative direction),\n\n$$\nD=-k{v}^{2},\n$$\n\nwhere $k>0$ is a constant of proportionality. Hence, the resultant force acting on the body is\n\n$$\nF=w+D=500g-k{v}^{2}.\n$$\n\nApplying Newton's second law, we obtain a separable first-order differential equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F & =ma \\\\ 500g-k{v}^{2} & =500\\,\\frac{dv}{dt} \\\\ \\frac{dv}{dt} & =g-\\frac{k}{500}{v}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're told that, at a particular moment, the body's velocity is $6.25\\,\\text{m/s}$ and its instantaneous acceleration is $7.35\\,{\\text{m/s}}^{2}.$ Substituting these values and $g=9.8$ into the ODE, we can solve for $k:$\n\n$$\n7.35=g-\\frac{k}{500}\\cdot (6.25)^{2}\\,⟹\\,k=31.36\\,\\text{kg/m}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have the following differential equation:\n\n$$\n\\frac{dv}{dt}=g-0.06272{v}^{2}\n$$\n\nSeparating variables and integrating both sides with respect to $t,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dv}{dt} & =g(1-0.0064{v}^{2}) \\\\ \\frac{1}{1-0.0064{v}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{dv}{dt} & =g \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{1-0.0064{v}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{dv}{dt}\\,dt & =g\\int dt \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{1-(0.08v)^{2}}\\,dv & =g\\int dt \\\\ \\frac{1}{0.08}\\operatorname{artanh}⁡(0.08v) & =gt+{C}_{1} \\\\ \\operatorname{artanh}⁡(0.08v) & =\\frac{2}{25}gt+C \\\\ 0.08v & =\\operatorname{tanh}⁡(\\frac{2}{25}gt+C) \\\\ v(t) & =\\frac{25}{2}\\operatorname{tanh}⁡(\\frac{2}{25}gt+C)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C=0.08{C}_{1}$ is a constant of integration.\n\nWe're told that the package is released from rest. So, we can apply the initial condition $v(0)=0,$ and solve for $C:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(0) & =\\frac{25}{2}\\operatorname{tanh}⁡(\\frac{2}{25}g\\cdot 0+C) \\\\ 0 & =\\frac{25}{2}\\operatorname{tanh}⁡(C) \\\\ \\operatorname{tanh}⁡(C) & =0 \\\\ C & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have the following expression for $v(t):$\n\n$$\nv(t)=\\frac{25}{2}\\operatorname{tanh}⁡(\\frac{2}{25}gt)\n$$\n\nFinally, the velocity of the package after $t=2$ seconds is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(2) & =\\frac{25}{2}\\operatorname{tanh}⁡(0.784\\cdot 2) \\\\  & =11.4588… \\\\  & ≈11.46\\,\\text{m/s},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to two decimal places." 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363912 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363913 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363912 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363914 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363912 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363915 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363912 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363916 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363912 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363917 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363912 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363912 1077 "selection" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363912 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363913 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363912 1080 #uuid "d41add49-9d20-5afc-a000-657e5f7f4ea1" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363913 1081 "11.46\\,\\text{m/s}" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363913 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363913 1084 #uuid "346ab56e-beaa-562f-862c-a9844fb858df" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363914 1081 "12.25\\,\\text{m/s}" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363914 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363914 1084 #uuid "e7361f91-44bc-5f80-952d-718ef667abf3" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363915 1081 "10.18\\,\\text{m/s}" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363915 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363915 1084 #uuid "e8ec8476-415c-5f91-8921-e745e404fb30" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363916 1081 "13.64\\,\\text{m/s}" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186363916 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 175921860