 is in the denominator, we can multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the denominator. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 49}\\frac{x-49}{7\\sqrt{x}-x} & ={lim}_{x\\to 49}\\frac{(x-49)(7\\sqrt{x}+x)}{(7\\sqrt{x}-x)(7\\sqrt{x}+x)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 49}\\frac{(x-49)(7\\sqrt{x}+x)}{{(7\\sqrt{x})}^{2}-{x}^{2}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 49}\\frac{(x-49)(7\\sqrt{x}+x)}{49x-{x}^{2}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 49}\\frac{(x-49)(7\\sqrt{x}+x)}{-x(x-49)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 49}\\frac{7\\sqrt{x}+x}{-x} \\\\  & =\\frac{7\\sqrt{49}+49}{-49} \\\\  & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364213 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364214 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364213 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364215 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364213 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364216 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364213 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364217 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364213 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364218 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364213 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364213 1077 "selection" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364213 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364218 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364213 1080 #uuid "c240bb4c-fe73-5b71-b152-73c9e43f9d42" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364214 1081 "-\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364214 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364214 1084 #uuid "d532a5a9-dfb8-5a1d-942e-95d1690d7b78" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364215 1081 "\\text{DNE}" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364215 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364215 1084 #uuid "fc592ac2-4a0e-57f5-bf88-501372716210" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364216 1081 "0" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364216 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 1