 17592186045585 true] [17592186364267 1074 "The tangent line approximation of $f(x)$ at the point $a=4.9$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(x) & =f(a)+{f}^{′}(a)(x-a) \\\\  & =f(4.9)+{f}^{′}(4.9)(x-4.9) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}+5(x-4.9).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can approximate $f(5)$ by evaluating the tangent line approximation at $x=5.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(5) & ≈L(5) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}+5(5-4.9) \\\\  & =0.5+5(0.1) \\\\  & =0.5+0.5 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364268 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364269 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364268 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364270 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364268 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364271 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364268 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364272 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364268 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364273 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364268 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364268 1077 "selection" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364268 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364271 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364268 1080 #uuid "9eab3715-18a6-5730-8fe5-e51bfb1e5480" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364269 1081 "3" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364269 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364269 1084 #uuid "41e41d02-e31c-5fde-af4e-364277438f57" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364270 1081 "6" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364270 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364270 1084 #uuid "f4b57802-e924-5131-8eb0-e5f905a7a603" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364271 1081 "1" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364271 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364271 1084 #uuid "a3fd4449-d24c-5709-8833-9b082d62f80f" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364272 1081 