/ref 17592186045493 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364275 1077 "selection" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364275 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364279 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364275 1080 #uuid "bb4f3c7c-e4ee-5e4c-b335-74fd3d353cc3" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364276 1081 "28" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364276 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364276 1084 #uuid "25a08dc9-3cb6-5089-97c7-357d91227a9e" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364277 1081 "16" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364277 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364277 1084 #uuid "d56d0706-25a5-5640-9ebf-ffe10838678d" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364278 1081 "-28" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364278 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364278 1084 #uuid "7e5bcaec-d21d-5413-aed1-000bd1e324ab" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364279 1081 "-4" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364279 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364279 1084 #uuid "41672e88-c38c-5f6e-be1d-18ddac2760b8" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364280 1081 "4" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364280 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364280 1084 #uuid "3bcb8442-842d-5164-bd3c-12c3c5c71784" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364281 1068 #edb/ref 17592186364282 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364281 1069 "q-49678" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364281 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364281 1071 "Evaluate ${\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }12x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364281 1072 #uuid "6d40fd3d-7b15-59ca-8ee5-88d3927298a9" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364281 1074 "Let's use integration by parts. We set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=12x & ⇒ & {u}^{′}=12 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x) & ⇒ & v=-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 12x\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =12x\\cdot (-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x))-\\int (-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x))\\cdot 12\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }12x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =-12x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x){|}_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }+12{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-12x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x){|}_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }+12\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x){|}_{-\\pi }^{\\pi } \\\\  & =-12[\\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi )+\\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡(-\\pi )] \\\\  & +12[\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi )-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-\\pi )] \\\\  & =-12[-\\pi -\\pi ]+12[0-0] \\\\  & =-12[-2\\pi ] \\\\  & =24\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364282 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364283 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364282 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364284 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364282 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364285 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364282 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364286 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364282 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364287 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364282 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364282 1077 "selection" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364282 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364285 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364282 1080 #uuid "ce18f523-92fa-512f-8b3f-d199baff422a" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364283 1081 "\\frac{2\\pi }{5}" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364283 1083 #edb/re