t\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 81}\\frac{\\sqrt{x}-9}{x-81} & ={lim}_{x\\to 81}\\frac{(\\sqrt{x}-9)(\\sqrt{x}+9)}{(x-81)(\\sqrt{x}+9)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 81}\\frac{{(\\sqrt{x})}^{2}-{9}^{2}}{(x-81)(\\sqrt{x}+9)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 81}\\frac{x-81}{(x-81)(\\sqrt{x}+9)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 81}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}+9} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{81}+9} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{18}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364289 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364290 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364289 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364291 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364289 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364292 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364289 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364293 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364289 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364294 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364289 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364289 1077 "selection" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364289 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364290 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364289 1080 #uuid "9be15f5b-4dfd-5c9a-b5d3-63f919468c29" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364290 1081 "\\frac{1}{18}" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364290 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364290 1084 #uuid "291fc5d5-d0d0-5f2d-9111-133b55d5b8f2" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364291 1081 "1" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364291 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364291 1084 #uuid "1074e9c7-e767-5c2f-8a74-77aca7fd2e0b" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364292 1081 "\\text{DNE}" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364292 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364292 1084 #uuid "00795bba-ee35-5d22-bd7b-ee65c80fb081" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364293 1081 "\\frac{1}{3}" 13194139533446 17592186045585 t