1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally:\n\n- If $x=0$, we get $y=0$ and the corresponding point is $(0,0).$\n\n- If $x=-1$, we get $y=-3$ and the corresponding point is $(-1,-3).$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364323 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364324 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364323 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364325 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364323 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364326 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364323 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364327 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364323 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364328 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364323 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364323 1077 "selection" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364323 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364325 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364323 1080 #uuid "e462412c-3cbc-5541-9147-125fc8a64b29" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364324 1081 "$(0,-1)$ and $(0,-3)$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364324 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364324 1084 #uuid "b4b0f044-128c-5f1b-aa69-2500dbaf5ea2" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364325 1081 "$(0,0)$ and $(-1,-3)$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364325 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364325 1084 #uuid "bdd3ddf3-f39a-5e23-9542-809cca8045dd" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364326 1081 "$(0,3)$ and $(0,-3)$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364326 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364326 1084 #uuid "cd3c3702-cba3-57ad-b3e0-2c994913bd41" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364327 1081 "$(3,0)$ and $(-1,0)$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364327 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364327 1084 #uuid "71ef2f17-55ba-507e-8bbc-fc7b6bfebfc5" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true]