nnection between polar and Cartesian coordinates gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta , \\\\ y & =r\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & ={sin}^{2}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, along our curve, we have $x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta $ and $y={sin}^{2}⁡\\theta $, where $0\\le \\theta \\le \\frac{\\pi }{2}.$ \n\nNow, since $f(x,y)={x}^{2}+{y}^{2}$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ,r\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ) & =(\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta )^{2}+({sin}^{2}⁡\\theta )^{2} \\\\  & ={sin}^{2}⁡\\theta {cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{4}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & ={sin}^{2}⁡\\theta ({cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta ) \\\\  & ={sin}^{2}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(\\theta ) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}\\theta }(\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )=\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand therefore\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}\\theta } & =\\sqrt{(\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )^{2}+(\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta )^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1} \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nFinally, we now evaluate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}s & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}f(r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ,r\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )\\,\\sqrt{{r}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}\\theta })}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \\cdot 1\\cdot \\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta }{2}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\theta -\\operatorname{sin}⁡2\\theta }{4}\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi -0}{4}-\\frac{0-0}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364406 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364407 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364406 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364408 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364406 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364409 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364406 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364410 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364406 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364411 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364406 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364406 1077 "selection" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364406 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364408 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364406 1080 #uuid "5e304ce4-5b90-51ac-8564-dc2bcdec4f03" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364407 1081 "\\frac{\\pi }{2}" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364407 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364407 1084 #uuid "3e48e2f8-a998-591f-85a7-74216c330826" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364408 1081 "\\frac{\\pi }{4}" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364408 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364408 1084 #uuid "86c854f3-9b37-56bf-8ed0-d656aca9cb87" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364409 1081 "\\pi " 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364409 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364409 1084 #uuid "b16fdea2-eae9-5267-a3ec-033d8b940279" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364410 1081 "3\\pi " 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364410 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364410 1084 #uuid "828d078c-1cec-5c53-b243-49495f238d47" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364411 1081 "2\\pi " 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364411 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045