text{d}u \\\\  & =-1\\,024\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}{u}^{4}\\,{|}_{1}^{\\sqrt{2}/2} \\\\  & =-256((\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})^{4}-{1}^{4}) \\\\  & =-256(-\\frac{3}{4}) \\\\  & =192\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364420 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364421 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364420 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364422 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364420 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364423 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364420 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364424 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364420 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364425 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364420 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364420 1077 "selection" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364420 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364421 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364420 1080 #uuid "7944764b-8f2e-517b-9311-deccaafc6156" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364421 1081 "192" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364421 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364421 1084 #uuid "49adc8e9-1dc5-5cb5-9175-f91e269efe35" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364422 1081 "96" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364422 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364422 1084 #uuid "e94aff50-1cf2-58b3-85e2-e76471a133a5" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364423 1081 "256" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364423 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364423 1084 #uuid "7fdf46cb-8dea-538a-974a-83bf0db567f5" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364424 1081 "512" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364424 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364424 1084 #uuid "119dacc9-0e3b-5285-87d0-21d3cc26e860" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364425 1081 "384" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364425 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364425 1084 #uuid "bddd3fe2-39af-5dc8-a534-e22068d4a73c" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364426 1068 #edb/ref 17592186364427 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364426 1069 "q-78463" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364426 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364426 1071 "Suppose that a matrix $B$ has characteristic polynomial $p(\\lambda )=(1+\\lambda )^{4}(1-\\lambda )^{2}(4-\\lambda )^{3},$ and for the eigenvalue $\\lambda =-1,$ there is exactly $1$ eigenvector. If a basis of ${R}^{9}$ consists of linearly independent generalized eigenvectors of $B$, how many of these generalized eigenvectors of rank greater than $1$ correspond to the eigenvalue $\\lambda =-1?$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364426 1072 #uuid "246e62ce-be4d-58bc-8aa3-d8a9e5b8b661" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364426 1074 "The number of generalized eigenvectors of rank greater than $1$ that correspond to an eigenvalue $\\lambda $ is equal to the difference between the algebraic multiplicity and the geometric multiplicity of $\\lambda .$\n\nIn the characteristic polynomial\n\n$$\np(\\lambda )=(1+\\lambda )^{4}(1-\\lambda )^{2}(4-\\lambda )^{3},\n$$\n\nwe see that the root $\\lambda =-1$ has multiplicity $4.$ So the algebraic multiplicity of the eigenvalue $\\lambda =-1$ is $4.$\n\nHowever, there is only $1$ eigenvector corresponding to the eigenvalue $\\lambda =-1,$ so the geometric multiplicity of the eigenvalue $\\lambda =-1$ is $1.$\n\nTherefore, the number of generalized eigenvectors of rank greater than $1$ corresponding to $\\lambda =-1$ is $4-1=3.$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364427 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364428 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364427 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364429 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364427 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364430 1319413