 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}16 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-(-10)I)x=0$ gives the eigenvector ${v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}].$ Dividing ${v}_{2}$ by its norm $‖{v}_{2}‖=\\sqrt{17},$ we get \n\n$$\n\\frac{{v}_{2}}{‖{v}_{2}‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{17}}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{17}} \\\\ -\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{17}}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n**Step 3.** We construct the diagonal matrix $D$ and the orthogonal matrix $P$ in the usual way, and this gives us the following:\n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}7 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -10\\end{aligned}],\\,P=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{17}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{17}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{17}} & -\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{17}}\\end{aligned}]\n$$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364516 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364517 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364516 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364518 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364516 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364519 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364516 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364520 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364516 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364521 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364516 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364516 1077 "selection" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364516 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364518 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364516 1080 #uuid "537c6748-dc18-5328-8608-350f3c43bf42" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364517 1081 "$D=[\\begin{aligned}7 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -10\\end{aligned}]$ and $P=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -4\\end{aligned}]$" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364517 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364517 1084 #uuid "56f0e8db-19ca-5e1a-acef-433c78628572" 13194139533446 17592186045585 true] [17592186364518 1081 "$D=[\\begin{aligned}7 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -10\\end{alig